# =============================================================================
# MAQAAMU IBRAHIM TRAVEL AGENCY — environment
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` (local) or set the variables in the host's
# dashboard (production). Every one is optional — the site builds and runs
# without any of them.
# =============================================================================


# CONTENT MODE ----------------------------------------------------------------
# LEAVE THIS UNSET FOR PRODUCTION. The default is `live`.
#
# live  (default)  Every record still marked 'awaiting-client' is stripped
#                  before it reaches a component, and sections with nothing
#                  confirmed remove themselves. Search indexing is allowed.
#
# draft            An internal review mode. Outstanding content slots render
#                  with a visible marker so the team can see exactly what is
#                  still missing, and robots.txt DISALLOWS indexing so a
#                  preview link cannot be picked up by search engines.
#
# Set it to `draft` only when reviewing what is outstanding:
#   VITE_CONTENT_MODE=draft npm run build
#
# VITE_CONTENT_MODE=draft


# ENQUIRY DELIVERY ------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional HTTPS endpoint that accepts a JSON POST of the enquiry form.
# Works with Formspree, Web3Forms, a Netlify function, or anything similar.
#
# Leave it unset and the form composes the enquiry into a WhatsApp message
# (or an email) using the confirmed channel in src/content/contact.ts — which
# means the form is useful from day one with no backend at all.
#
# VITE_ENQUIRY_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
